      <h3>Borrowed sequence</h3>
      <p>Most research peptides are either fragments of a naturally occurring protein or synthetic analogs engineered to resemble one. How closely the sequence tracks the native signal determines which receptor family will accept it \u2014 and how predictable its behavior is.</p>
