      <h3>Shape, not identity</h3>
      <p>A receptor binds a conformation, not a name. Ipamorelin shares almost no sequence with ghrelin and activates ghrelin's receptor anyway, because it presents the right shape. This is what \u201chacking\u201d a pathway actually means at the molecular level.</p>
